{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining Platform is an incremental game where you mine resources at different locations to get more upgrades and mine faster. You decide what to use for mining ranging from cannons to missiles or the use of miners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of the Mining Platform and aim where to mine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve and mine 15 different resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and apply more than 80 different upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 different minable locations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your arsenal with weapons, miners gunners and more:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937730/extras/c77d5f87e9a0895159fcec77a06a68a0.poster.avif?t=1757615541\" width=750 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937730/extras/c77d5f87e9a0895159fcec77a06a68a0.webm?t=1757615541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937730/extras/c77d5f87e9a0895159fcec77a06a68a0.mp4?t=1757615541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you mine the harder it's going to get:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937730/extras/661e800c61c9c3d8556cc39f3a693434.poster.avif?t=1757615541\" width=850 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937730/extras/661e800c61c9c3d8556cc39f3a693434.webm?t=1757615541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https